# 可选 meta.yaml 示例（写入 outputDir/meta.yaml）

```yaml
generated_by: fe-prd-plan
status: draft   # draft | confirmed
mode: prd+figma # prd-only | prd+figma | figma-only
output_dir: docs/prd/example/
source_urls:
  - https://example.com/doc
figma:
  - url: https://www.figma.com/design/xxx/yyy?node-id=1-2
    scope_node_id: "1:2"
created_at: "2026-07-28T00:00:00+08:00"
confirmed_at: null
```

正式文件不要包含本说明标题；只写 YAML 正文。
